{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"horse_harness","model_identifier":"horse_harness","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# horse_harness\n\nHorse harness (B1 attachment): draught harness for `horse`, used with the `pull` clip.\n\nPadded collar with brass hames, back pad, belly band, breeching around the rump, long traces down both sides, bridle with blinkers. Built on the full horse skeleton (same bone names and pivots) and a copy of every horse clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the horse skeleton or simply played in sync with the horse.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.8..8.8, y 32.4..71.2, z -51.7..36.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop |  |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once |  |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold |  |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n- `slot_trace_r` on `body` at (8.35, 41.75, 36)\n- `slot_trace_l` on `body` at (-8.35, 41.75, 36)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Cubes on neck and head carry the same fixed cube rotations as the horse (-38 / -52 deg).\n- slot_trace_r / slot_trace_l are the trace ends where a cart or siege engine hooks on (they ride with the body; the horse slot_harness at the chest is the main pulling point).\n"},"description":"# horse_harness\n\nHorse harness (B1 attachment): draught harness for `horse`, used with the `pull` clip.\n\nPadded collar with brass hames, back pad, belly band, breeching around the rump, long traces down both sides, bridle with blinkers. Built on the full horse skeleton (same bone names and pivots) and a copy of every horse clip (same names and keys), so it can be bound to the horse skeleton or simply played in sync with the horse.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.8..8.8, y 32.4..71.2, z -51.7..36.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `trot` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `gallop` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `pull` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop |  |\n| `rear` | 1.8 | once |  |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold |  |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 55, -2)\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 44, -30)\n- `slot_trace_r` on `body` at (8.35, 41.75, 36)\n- `slot_trace_l` on `body` at (-8.35, 41.75, 36)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Cubes on neck and head carry the same fixed cube rotations as the horse (-38 / -52 deg).\n- slot_trace_r / slot_trace_l are the trace ends where a cart or siege engine hooks on (they ride with the body; the horse slot_harness at the chest is the main pulling point).\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"collar","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,47.0,-32.5],"to":[5.5,53.0,-17.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,48,-24],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,86,11.0,92.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26,78,41.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[11,86,22.0,92.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[41,78,56.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[40,0,51.0,15.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[51,0,62.0,15.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f1044fa0-3a96-5f6b-b10c-8851a079acc8","rotation":[-38,0,0]},{"name":"hames","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":f